    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something Is Coming...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The elves have been hunted, taken, or killed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Falner, the elf king and his two children are the only free elves that remain, hidden in a campsite, but not for long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Stranger and his disciples will not stop until they are found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story based RPG, Tales Of The Lost: The Stranger is the first in a series of stories set in a fantasy world that includes Pirates, Ghosts, Orcs and other monsters not yet found......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist today and be the first to play when released.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Information\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story based adventure</strong>: Play as three characters, experience their story and find out what hunts them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based battles: </strong>Use the power of the elves to fight monsters, orcs and humans.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card</strong>\u00a0<strong>Collection: </strong>Find collectable cards of characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Achievements:</strong>\u00a0Earn achievements by completing objectives in the story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
